**DIRAC
.TITLE
  Xe atom
.WAVE F ! Activate integral and wave functions module
#.ANALYZE
.4INDEX
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
.PCMOUT
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
0
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
.PRINT
0
.INTFLG
1 1 0
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
*SCF
# Xe atom (Z=54)
.CLOSED SHELL
30  24
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0D-9  1.0D-7
# read starting MOs
.MAXITR
2
#################################################
**ANALYZE
.MULPOP
*MULPOP
.VECPOP
all   
all   
**MOLTRA
.NO2IND
.NO4IND
.NOMDCI
# all occupied shells
.ACTIVE
1..15
1..12
.PRPTRA
*PRPTRA
# we need this print level to get all MO mtx elements printed
.PRINT
2
# eEDM operators
.OPERATOR
 'Heff_EDM'
 iBETAGAM
 EDM
 COMFACTOR
 1.0000
*END OF
